s223:hasMeasurementLocation a rdf:Property ;
    rdfs:label "has measurement location" ;
    rdfs:comment "The relation hasMeasurementLocation binds the ObservableProperty representing a measurement to the topological location where the measurement is made. The measurement location can be a ConnectionPoint, Connection, Segment, or PhysicalSpace." .

